,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2528.539817482,"data":"THE SCHEDULE (the prediction under test)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2528.540732546,"data":"  A Python loop over DDA steps unrolls at trace time. The question is\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2528.541610323,"data":"  whether tinygrad fuses across the unrolled body or emits one kernel per\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2528.542579661,"data":"  step. These are the counts, per max_steps, on this card:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2528.543498218,"data":"   max_steps  launches  distinct  launches-8\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2528.544443274,"data":"           1         8         6           0\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2528.545436744,"data":"           4        12         9           4\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2528.546386575,"data":"          16        24        21          16\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2528.547318627,"data":"          32        40        37          32\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2528.548209414,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2528.549032152,"data":"PERFORMANCE, both sides, same card, same run, same world, max_steps=32\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2528.549845553,"data":"  ref render / ref step are cudaEvent medians in MICROSECONDS. tg is the\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2528.550592605,"data":"  sum of per-kernel device times for the whole generated graph.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2528.551381014,"data":"    batch  ref render us   ref step us  tg device ms   tg/ref  tg peak MiB               tg state\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2528.552094326,"data":"      256              -             -        13.755        -          0.0          not attempted\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2528.552958757,"data":"      512          228.0         278.5        13.573    59.53            -          fits, 140 MiB\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2528.553765089,"data":"     1024          334.8         381.3         8.754    26.15            -           fits, 31 MiB\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2528.554479299,"data":"     2048          579.4         626.7        17.323     29.9            -           fits, 62 MiB\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2528.555452631,"data":"     4096         1146.0        1198.8             -        -            -          fits, 125 MiB\n"}
