,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2528.560019307,"data":"WHAT TO READ\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2528.560927003,"data":"  * A framework emits a graph of kernels; the 4.55 M baseline is a\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2528.56180874,"data":"    whole-step number over 7 launches. Dividing one by the other is a\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2528.562839672,"data":"    category error. The defensible comparison is render against render at\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2528.563810477,"data":"    the same batch, and the batch table above is the same-card, same-run\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2528.564763578,"data":"    version of that.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2528.565574234,"data":"  * Every timing is printed next to the DDA step count of its own run.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2528.566401254,"data":"    A throughput number without the workload behind it is not a\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2528.56737711,"data":"    measurement; see minecu_ref/buried_agent_fix.md for what that costs.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2528.568139252,"data":"  * No number here is transcribed from any notes file. Every figure is\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2528.569069081,"data":"    produced by an instrument in this notebook on this card.\n"}
